    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/2dbc64425c488e26595fa574efc86ace.avif?t=1752099718\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of a colossal floating fortress in Skyfire: Death from Above, a real-time strategy and bullet heaven hybrid set in an alternate history where humanity has risen to the skies to survive an endless war. Navigate a world torn apart by aerial battles, plunder vital resources, and build your citadel to withstand relentless waves of enemies. Combine tactical combat, resource management, and modular upgrades for a dynamic and engaging experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/8d4da0107245229fb276d67b2454c702.avif?t=1752099718\" width=600 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/f4a6f126b43d310efc472169e53cac24.poster.avif?t=1752099718\" width=800 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/f4a6f126b43d310efc472169e53cac24.webm?t=1752099718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/f4a6f126b43d310efc472169e53cac24.mp4?t=1752099718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and manage resources to build and customize your floating fortress, adapting defensive and offensive modules to face growing threats. Design the ultimate citadel, capable of withstanding any siege and dominating the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/ecaf523f8f3feb8ce65ff8e9bce7e552.avif?t=1752099718\" width=600 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/963a012f848bacf52ac7cf2290b8c9ef.poster.avif?t=1752099718\" width=800 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/963a012f848bacf52ac7cf2290b8c9ef.webm?t=1752099718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/963a012f848bacf52ac7cf2290b8c9ef.mp4?t=1752099718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into a war-torn world, where the skies are the new battlefield. Discover valuable resources, face unique challenges, and unravel the secrets of a world in constant conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/6501ee0844ad905d428c8e55d624afc4.avif?t=1752099718\" width=600 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/f1152dbbb29a50ad909b2ad479ac6f82.poster.avif?t=1752099718\" width=800 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/f1152dbbb29a50ad909b2ad479ac6f82.webm?t=1752099718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/f1152dbbb29a50ad909b2ad479ac6f82.mp4?t=1752099718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense aerial battles, utilizing tactical skills and real-time strategies to overcome your enemies. Adapt your tactics to each encounter, from swarms of light fighters to colossal rivals.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/2dbc64425c488e26595fa574efc86ace.avif?t=1752099718\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of a colossal floating fortress in Skyfire: Death from Above, a real-time strategy and bullet heaven hybrid set in an alternate history where humanity has risen to the skies to survive an endless war. Navigate a world torn apart by aerial battles, plunder vital resources, and build your citadel to withstand relentless waves of enemies. Combine tactical combat, resource management, and modular upgrades for a dynamic and engaging experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/8d4da0107245229fb276d67b2454c702.avif?t=1752099718\" width=600 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/f4a6f126b43d310efc472169e53cac24.poster.avif?t=1752099718\" width=800 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/f4a6f126b43d310efc472169e53cac24.webm?t=1752099718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/f4a6f126b43d310efc472169e53cac24.mp4?t=1752099718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and manage resources to build and customize your floating fortress, adapting defensive and offensive modules to face growing threats. Design the ultimate citadel, capable of withstanding any siege and dominating the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/ecaf523f8f3feb8ce65ff8e9bce7e552.avif?t=1752099718\" width=600 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/963a012f848bacf52ac7cf2290b8c9ef.poster.avif?t=1752099718\" width=800 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/963a012f848bacf52ac7cf2290b8c9ef.webm?t=1752099718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/963a012f848bacf52ac7cf2290b8c9ef.mp4?t=1752099718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into a war-torn world, where the skies are the new battlefield. Discover valuable resources, face unique challenges, and unravel the secrets of a world in constant conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/6501ee0844ad905d428c8e55d624afc4.avif?t=1752099718\" width=600 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/f1152dbbb29a50ad909b2ad479ac6f82.poster.avif?t=1752099718\" width=800 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/f1152dbbb29a50ad909b2ad479ac6f82.webm?t=1752099718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/f1152dbbb29a50ad909b2ad479ac6f82.mp4?t=1752099718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense aerial battles, utilizing tactical skills and real-time strategies to overcome your enemies. Adapt your tactics to each encounter, from swarms of light fighters to colossal rivals.</p>",
